[SI_KEYBOARD_LINKACCOUNT_CROWN_LOSS_WARNING] = "Linking an account will transfer all of your NA Server characters, DLC, and Collections to the DMM Client, but any unspent Crowns or Crown Gems will be permanently lost. It is not possible to transfer characters from the EU server. If you are a recurring ESO Plus member, your ESO Plus subscription will be cancelled, but your remaining subscription time will be credited in a few days. When your subscription time has elapsed, you may re-subscribe through DMM. Please check the DMM member site for more information."
